@@ -313,3 +313,14 @@ contracts document `jev-1.13.0` and finite rubric scores including fractions. Ne
 use the pin while all previous alias records survive. Connection and model writes settle before
 preference binding; an acknowledgement/preference failure retains the committed connection for
 retry, with explicit inference still off. Navigation/unmount/service changes fence delayed binding.
+
+## Draft, accepted configuration and execution
+
+Source setup inspection is a Renderer draft; it must not remove an accepted selection or disable
+its purpose. Explicit save/clear commands retain their established meanings. The current editor's
+acknowledged create/save/model/bind steps are transitional, not an atomic source-save operation.
+The target compound command belongs on the existing Provider facade and Personal transaction,
+with exact revision, connection identity, stale-result handling and retained acknowledgement proof.
+The authoritative frontend/backend design is
+[the model decision contract](../../../../../docs/modules/model-decisions.md#frontend-and-backend-design).
+Do not create another settings/credential authority or treat a mounted UI callback as commit proof.
